# The age PUBLIC key that fuzz-nightly.yml encrypts every finding to (owner decision (62)(1),
# key installed by decision (66)(4), 2026-10-27). The private key is held by the owner and is never
# in this repository or in CI. This file must hold exactly one key line: a missing, empty,
# placeholder or malformed recipient FAILS the seal step (tools/fuzz-seal-finding.sh), so the job
# goes red rather than silently keeping nothing.
#
# Decrypt a downloaded artifact with
#   age -d -i ~/burrow-security/fuzz-crash.key <target>.age | tar -x
